:"滕縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"滕县","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8c47741f-db0e-11ef-a217-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班志，薛縣屬魯國，夏奚仲之國；後遷于邳，仲虺居之。括地志：故薛城在今徐州滕縣界。史記正義曰：薛故城在今徐州滕縣南四十四里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志，薛县属鲁国，夏奚仲之国；后迁于邳，仲虺居之。括地志：故薛城在今徐州滕县界。史记正义曰：薛故城在今徐州滕县南四十四里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c477412-db0e-11ef-a831-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"杜佑","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜佑","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c477424-db0e-11ef-92ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"項","people_name_jianti_auto":"项","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c477425-db0e-11ef-9287-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"靖郭","people_name_jianti_auto":"靖郭","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8c477426-db0e-11ef-8448-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武安","people_name_jianti_auto":"武安","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c477427-db0e-11ef-b2e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"嬰","people_name_jianti_auto":"婴","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"8c477428-db0e-11ef-9c1d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"靖郭君","people_name_jianti_auto":"靖郭君","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"8c477429-db0e-11ef-adca-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"靖郭","people_name_jianti_auto":"靖郭","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"8c47742a-db0e-11ef-a1f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"駟鈞","people_name_jianti_auto":"驷钧","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"8c47742b-db0e-11ef-af6f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"靖郭侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"靖郭侯","start_index":97,"tongjian_id":"8c47742c-db0e-11ef-8823-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"戰國","place_name_jianti_auto":"战国","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c47742d-db0e-11ef-b1aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c47742e-db0e-11ef-a485-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"8c47742f-db0e-11ef-a839-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"8c477430-db0e-11ef-9f72-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"杜佑曰：戰國之際，秦、項之間，權設班寵有加賜邑封君者，蓋假其位號，或空受其爵，如靖郭、武安之類是也。至漢尤多，蓋在封爵之外別加美號。史記·列傳云：嬰諡爲靖郭君。索隱曰：靖郭，或封邑號，故漢駟鈞封靖郭侯。","note_content_jianti_auto":"杜佑曰：战国之际，秦、项之间，权设班宠有加赐邑封君者，盖假其位号，或空受其爵，如靖郭、武安之类是也。至汉尤多，盖在封爵之外别加美号。史记·列传云：婴谥为靖郭君。索隐曰：靖郭，或封邑号，故汉驷钧封靖郭侯。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8c477423-db0e-11ef-8029-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"記·曾子問：諸侯出，命國家五官而後行。註云：五官，五大夫典事者。命者，敕之以其職。正義云：案太宰職云：建其牧，立其監，設其參，傅其伍，是諸侯有三卿、五大夫。經云五官，故云五大夫。以屬官大夫，其數衆多，直云五者，據典國事言之。不云命卿者，或從君出行，或雖在國留守，總主羣吏，如三公然，不專主一事，且尊之。旣命五大夫，則卿亦命之可知，故不顯言命卿也。余謂此所謂五官，蓋亦言典事五大夫也。數，所角翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"记·曾子问：诸侯出，命国家五官而后行。注云：五官，五大夫典事者。命者，敕之以其职。正义云：案太宰职云：建其牧，立其监，设其参，傅其伍，是诸侯有三卿、五大夫。经云五官，故云五大夫。以属官大夫，其数众多，直云五者，据典国事言之。不云命卿者，或从君出行，或虽在国留守，总主群吏，如三公然，不专主一事，且尊之。既命五大夫，则卿亦命之可知，故不显言命卿也。余谓此所谓五官，盖亦言典事五大夫也。数，所角翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8c477433-db0e-11ef-bd2c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"齊王","official_note":"齊王是齊國的君主，在戰國時期為諸侯國的最高統治者，此處指齊威王或齊宣王，負責封賞田嬰於薛地，體現其行政權力。","official_rank":"王爵","source_snippet":"齊王封田嬰於薛","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"65b5df14-f185-46ae-9900-2f5a7ff7ae5e"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"封爵","official_name":"靖郭君","official_note":"靖郭君是田嬰的封號，源自齊王封賞，屬於戰國時期貴族封爵，此處表示田嬰獲得封地薛後的尊稱，有助於其專權。","official_rank":"君爵","source_snippet":"號曰靖郭君","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"f1d32103-f83c-4560-9795-827fa7f3950e"},{"confidence":0.7,"official_category":"財政","official_name":"五官","official_note":"五官可能指戰國時期齊國的財政或行政官員，負責會計或統計事務，此處靖郭君建議齊王每日聽取其報告以加強管理。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"五官之計","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"93bbf1c8-e838-48c3-b810-c3be101b74e6"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-350,"link_death_year":-301,"link_td_description":"齐宣王，本名田辟疆，战国时代齐国国君，齐威王之子。","link_td_id":"Q10000604","link_td_number_id":320027,"people_name":"齊王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐王","people_xingming":"田辟彊","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c477438-db0e-11ef-b958-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[田辟彊]"},{"link_birth_year":-350,"link_death_year":-301,"link_td_description":"齐宣王，本名田辟疆，战国时代齐国国君，齐威王之子。","link_td_id":"Q10000604","link_td_number_id":320027,"people_name":"齊王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐王","people_xingming":"田辟彊","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c47743d-db0e-11ef-b0dc-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[田辟彊]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3齊王封田嬰於薛，號曰靖郭君。靖郭君言於齊王曰：「五官之計，不可不日聽而數覽也。」王從之；已而厭之，悉以委靖郭君。靖郭君由是得專齊之權。","content_fanyi":"齐王把薛地封给田婴，号称靖郭君。靖郭君对齐王说：“五官的计簿，不可不每天听取并经常翻阅。”齐王听从了；不久便感到厌烦，把事情全部委托给靖郭君。靖郭君由此得以独揽齐国的大权。","content_jianti_auto":"3齐王封田婴于薛，号曰靖郭君。靖郭君言于齐王曰：「五官之计，不可不日听而数览也。」王从之；已而厌之，悉以委靖郭君。靖郭君由是得专齐之权。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":217,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 四十八年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c477411-db0e-11ef-a47c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-321},"tongjian_id":"8c477411-db0e-11ef-a47c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c627625-db0e-11ef-82ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c627626-db0e-11ef-becd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"退齋","people_name_jianti_auto":"退斋","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c627627-db0e-11ef-8a9c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「國」下有「雖小」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退齋校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「国」下有「虽小」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退斋校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c627624-db0e-11ef-9564-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8c627623-db0e-11ef-8bb7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"平","people_name_jianti_auto":"平","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c627629-db0e-11ef-8acf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"子之","people_name_jianti_auto":"子之","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8c62762a-db0e-11ef-87d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"平","people_name_jianti_auto":"平","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8c62762b-db0e-11ef-b932-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"噲","people_name_jianti_auto":"哙","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"8c62762c-db0e-11ef-b181-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"飭，整也，修也，治也。治，直之翻。飭君臣之義，言太子平將治子之僭王之罪也。明父子之位，言太子平當繼其父噲之位也。令，力政翻，命令也，號令也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"饬，整也，修也，治也。治，直之翻。饬君臣之义，言太子平将治子之僭王之罪也。明父子之位，言太子平当继其父哙之位也。令，力政翻，命令也，号令也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"8c627628-db0e-11ef-aa1e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"北地","place_name_jianti_auto":"北地","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8c627631-db0e-11ef-aa1c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c627632-db0e-11ef-94de-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c627633-db0e-11ef-af81-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"千乘","place_name_jianti_auto":"千乘","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8c627634-db0e-11ef-9cae-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"清河","place_name_jianti_auto":"清河","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8c627635-db0e-11ef-bbdb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"勃海","place_name_jianti_auto":"勃海","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8c627636-db0e-11ef-b40b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"將，卽亮翻，又音如字，領也。邑有先王之廟曰都。或曰：都，邑之大者。北地，齊之北境也，蓋漢千乘、清河、勃海之地。燕，因肩翻；下同。乘，繩證翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"将，即亮翻，又音如字，领也。邑有先王之庙曰都。或曰：都，邑之大者。北地，齐之北境也，盖汉千乘、清河、勃海之地。燕，因肩翻；下同。乘，绳证翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"8c627630-db0e-11ef-81ec-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"將軍","official_note":"將軍是古代軍事指揮官，此處指市被擔任將軍職務，參與燕國內亂。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"將軍市被與太子平謀攻子之","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"10c3069c-0541-4412-a331-55657f514b1e"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"齊王","official_note":"齊王是齊國的君主，此處指齊王參與燕國內政，支持太子平。","official_rank":"王","source_snippet":"齊王令人謂太子曰","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"21927457-1aa0-4887-bff6-78ee56c1e00b"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"太子","official_note":"太子是王位繼承人，此處指燕國太子平，在內亂中謀攻子之。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"太子因要黨聚衆","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"fb0c4274-59f4-42e0-8738-5b272a865a86"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"章子","official_note":"章子在此處被任命為將領，率領齊國軍隊伐燕，是軍事指揮官。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"齊王令章子將五都之兵","start_index":108,"tongjian_id":"b49eb7dd-97de-4610-8456-5ad347d27e33"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"燕王","official_note":"燕王是燕國的君主，此處指燕王噲，在齊國伐燕後被殺。","official_rank":"王","source_snippet":"遂殺燕王噲","start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"70d1a722-a62a-424f-9b6f-54a992d8e56a"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-350,"link_death_year":-301,"link_td_description":"齐宣王，本名田辟疆，战国时代齐国国君，齐威王之子。","link_td_id":"Q10000604","link_td_number_id":320027,"people_name":"齊王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐王","people_xingming":"田辟彊","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8c636626-db0e-11ef-9ea9-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[田辟彊]"},{"link_birth_year":-350,"link_death_year":-301,"link_td_description":"齐宣王，本名田辟疆，战国时代齐国国君，齐威王之子。","link_td_id":"Q10000604","link_td_number_id":320027,"people_name":"齊王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐王","people_xingming":"田辟彊","start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"8c6379e6-db0e-11ef-b38e-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[田辟彊]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/燕非强国","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，后赖五国之力，乐毅为将，然后胜齐，然卒于得七十城不能守...","context_before":"...春秋时最为僻小，能自见于中国者，不过三四，大率制命于齐。","source_end_index":40,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"736aac77-1802-441e-9402-8cea82e51826","source_start_index":31,"source_text":"七雄之际，为齐所取"}],"path":"四笔/卷三/燕非强国","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/序","excerpts":[{"context_after":"燕昭王以乐毅为将，合秦、赵、韩、魏之师，而后能雪耻于齐。...","context_before":"...犹且纳女归赂于齐，诚畏之也。战国时，齐、燕有不两立之势。","source_end_index":594,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"dafc8a02-71dc-5f44-b839-5f297d454005","source_start_index":572,"source_text":"子哙之乱，齐宣以五都之兵伐之，五旬而遂举燕。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/序","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3燕子之爲王三年，國內大亂。將軍市被與太子平謀攻子之。齊王令人謂太子曰：「寡人聞太子將飭君臣之義，明父子之位，寡人之國唯太子所以令之。」太子因要黨聚衆，使市被攻子之，不克。市被反攻太子。搆難數月，死者數萬人，百姓恫恐。齊王令章子將五都之兵，因北地之衆以伐燕。燕士卒不戰，城門不閉。齊人取子之，醢之，遂殺燕王噲。","content_fanyi":"子之在燕国为王三年，国内大乱。将军市被与太子姬平谋划攻打子之。齐王派人对燕太子说：“我听说太子将要整饬君臣大义、彰明父子名位，我齐国愿意听从您的命令。”燕太子于是邀集党羽、聚合部众，派市被攻打子之，没有攻克。市被反过来攻打太子。祸乱持续数月，死亡数万人，百姓惶恐不安。齐王命令章子率领五都的军队，并借助北方地区的兵众讨伐燕国。燕国士兵不肯交战，城门也不关闭。齐国人俘获子之，把他剁成肉酱，随后杀死燕王姬哙。","content_jianti_auto":"3燕子之为王三年，国内大乱。将军市被与太子平谋攻子之。齐王令人谓太子曰：「寡人闻太子将饬君臣之义，明父子之位，寡人之国唯太子所以令之。」太子因要党聚众，使市被攻子之，不克。市被反攻太子。搆难数月，死者数万人，百姓恫恐。齐王令章子将五都之兵，因北地之众以伐燕。燕士卒不战，城门不闭。齐人取子之，醢之，遂杀燕王哙。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":238,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三 (周紀三) / 赧王上 / 元年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c627621-db0e-11ef-9905-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-314},"tongjian_id":"8c627621-db0e-11ef-9905-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"書·仲虺之誥之辭。徯，戶禮翻，待也。后，君也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"书·仲虺之诰之辞。徯，户礼翻，待也。后，君也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8c6379fe-db0e-11ef-a53a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙岐","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵岐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c637a02-db0e-11ef-894f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"趙岐曰：係累，縛結也。係，戶計翻。累，力追翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"赵岐曰：系累，缚结也。系，户计翻。累，力追翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"8c637a01-db0e-11ef-98cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"重器，國之寶鎭。","note_content_jianti_auto":"重器，国之宝镇。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"8c637a03-db0e-11ef-b56e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c637a05-db0e-11ef-81ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c637a06-db0e-11ef-8bcc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"齊幷燕則地倍其舊。燕，因肩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"齐幷燕则地倍其旧。燕，因肩翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":150,"tongjian_id":"8c637a04-db0e-11ef-9618-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙岐","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵岐","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c637a08-db0e-11ef-89ba-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陸德明","people_name_jianti_auto":"陆德明","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c637a09-db0e-11ef-b370-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"令，力政翻。趙岐曰：旄，老旄；倪，弱小。陸德明曰：倪，謂翳倪小兒也。記·曲禮曰：八十、九十曰耄，註云：耄，惛忘也。旄，讀曰耄。倪，五兮翻。翳，與繄同，音煙兮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"令，力政翻。赵岐曰：旄，老旄；倪，弱小。陆德明曰：倪，谓翳倪小儿也。记·曲礼曰：八十、九十曰耄，注云：耄，惛忘也。旄，读曰耄。倪，五兮翻。翳，与繄同，音烟兮翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":174,"tongjian_id":"8c637a07-db0e-11ef-94a3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-350,"link_death_year":-301,"link_td_description":"齐宣王，本名田辟疆，战国时代齐国国君，齐威王之子。","link_td_id":"Q10000604","link_td_number_id":320027,"people_name":"齊王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐王","people_xingming":"田辟彊","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c637a0c-db0e-11ef-b65b-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[田辟彊]"},{"link_birth_year":-350,"link_death_year":-301,"link_td_description":"齐宣王，本名田辟疆，战国时代齐国国君，齐威王之子。","link_td_id":"Q10000604","link_td_number_id":320027,"people_name":"齊王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐王","people_xingming":"田辟彊","start_index":199,"tongjian_id":"8c637a13-db0e-11ef-b965-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[田辟彊]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"諸侯將謀救燕，齊王謂孟子曰：「諸侯多謀伐寡人者，何以待之？」對曰：「臣聞七十里爲政於天下者，湯是也；未聞以千里畏人者也。書曰：『徯我后，后來其蘇。』今燕虐其民，王往而征之，民以爲將拯己於水火之中也，簞食壺漿以迎王師。若殺其父兄，係累其子弟，毀其宗廟，遷其重器。如之何其可也！天下固畏齊之強也，今又倍地而不行仁政，是動天下之兵也。王速出令，反其旄倪，止其重器，謀於燕衆，置君而後去之，則猶可及止也。」齊王不聽。","content_fanyi":"诸侯们将要谋划援救燕国。齐王对孟子说：“诸侯中有很多在谋划讨伐我，该怎么应对？”孟子回答说：“我听说凭借七十里土地在天下推行政令的，是商王汤；从没听说拥有千里土地反而畏惧别人的。《尚书》说：‘等待我们的君主，君主来了，百姓就能复苏。’如今燕国虐待自己的百姓，大王前往征伐，燕国百姓认为您将把自己从水深火热中拯救出来，于是用竹筐盛着饭食、用壶盛着浆水迎接大王的军队。如果杀害他们的父兄，捆绑他们的子弟，毁坏他们的宗庙，搬走他们的重器，这怎么可以呢！天下本来畏惧齐国的强大，现在又扩大了一倍土地却不施行仁政，这是促使天下各国出兵啊。大王赶快发布命令，放回燕国的老人和孩子，停止搬运他们的重器，与燕国民众商议，选立新的国君然后离开，这样还来得及制止各国出兵。”齐王不肯听从。","content_jianti_auto":"诸侯将谋救燕，齐王谓孟子曰：「诸侯多谋伐寡人者，何以待之？」对曰：「臣闻七十里为政于天下者，汤是也；未闻以千里畏人者也。书曰：『徯我后，后来其苏。』今燕虐其民，王往而征之，民以为将拯己于水火之中也，箪食壶浆以迎王师。若杀其父兄，系累其子弟，毁其宗庙，迁其重器。如之何其可也！天下固畏齐之强也，今又倍地而不行仁政，是动天下之兵也。王速出令，反其旄倪，止其重器，谋于燕众，置君而后去之，则犹可及止也。」齐王不听。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":240,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三 (周紀三) / 赧王上 / 元年 / 第 5 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c6379fd-db0e-11ef-83c3-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-314},"tongjian_id":"8c6379fd-db0e-11ef-83c3-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-350,"link_death_year":-301,"link_td_description":"齐宣王，本名田辟疆，战国时代齐国国君，齐威王之子。","link_td_id":"Q10000604","link_td_number_id":320027,"people_name":"齊宣王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐宣王","people_xingming":"田辟彊","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c637a38-db0e-11ef-b947-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[田辟彊]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"4是歲，齊宣王薨，子湣王地立。","content_fanyi":"这一年，齐宣王去世，其子齐湣王田地即位。","content_jianti_auto":"4是岁，齐宣王薨，子湣王地立。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":242,"number":4,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三 (周紀三) / 赧王上 / 元年 / 第 7 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c637a36-db0e-11ef-9d22-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-314},"tongjian_id":"8c637a36-db0e-11ef-9d22-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"邪，余遮翻。邪，疑辭也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"邪，余遮翻。邪，疑辞也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf13-db0e-11ef-9142-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋遺","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋遗","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf15-db0e-11ef-b31c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf16-db0e-11ef-92fc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周武王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周武王","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf17-db0e-11ef-96e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"微子","people_name_jianti_auto":"微子","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf18-db0e-11ef-a48a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf19-db0e-11ef-854e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf1a-db0e-11ef-8082-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf1b-db0e-11ef-9355-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf1c-db0e-11ef-9acc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf1d-db0e-11ef-939c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"旣閉關絕約，則齊、楚之信使不通，故使宋遺借宋符以至齊。宋，姓也。周武王封微子於宋，子孫以國爲氏。","note_content_jianti_auto":"既闭关绝约，则齐、楚之信使不通，故使宋遗借宋符以至齐。宋，姓也。周武王封微子于宋，子孙以国为氏。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf14-db0e-11ef-9ebf-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"儀","people_name_jianti_auto":"仪","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf20-db0e-11ef-85b6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf21-db0e-11ef-8bb6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf22-db0e-11ef-9efd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"儀歸而詐疾，待齊、秦之交合乃朝。","note_content_jianti_auto":"仪归而诈疾，待齐、秦之交合乃朝。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf1f-db0e-11ef-a480-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"朝，直遙翻。使，疏吏翻。東西曰廣，南北曰袤。廣，古曠翻，又讀如字。袤，音茂。","note_content_jianti_auto":"朝，直遥翻。使，疏吏翻。东西曰广，南北曰袤。广，古旷翻，又读如字。袤，音茂。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf23-db0e-11ef-9eed-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_pa